  "headline": "Waiver Wire Is Running This League",
  "subhead": "Five managers are ahead or tied right now because of pickups, and Thug Life has Quentin Grimes to thank for it.",
  "zingers": [
   {
    "team": "Thug Life",
    "line": "Quentin Grimes put up 67 points and 14 threes in two games, and without him Thug Life would be losing 7-3 to BrookynDynasty."
   },
   {
    "team": "Nova Knicks",
    "line": "Cam Spencer's 27 assists, Nolan Traore's 38 points and Mikal Bridges' 25 have Nova Knicks up 7-2, and without those adds it's a 5-5 tie."
   },
   {
    "team": "Gopher Gold",
    "line": "Gopher Gold leads 7-3 on the strength of Devin Vassell and Matisse Thybulle; without them this is 5-5 and Suggs to be you is breathing."
   },
   {
    "team": "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw",
    "line": "Daniss Jenkins (46 points) and Saddiq Bey (7 threes) are the only reason Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw is 5-5 and not 4-6."
   },
   {
    "team": "theInfamous",
    "line": "Mo Bamba's 24 defensive rebounds have theInfamous at 5-5; keep Jaxson Hayes and this is 4-5. A pickup of that size is how you steal a week."
